{"_v":1,"id":"girl-from-the-north-country-2022","cs":77,"rc":12,"bd":{"positive":7,"mixed":3,"negative":2},"rv":[{"cn":"Ann Treneman","o":"The Times (UK)","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.co.uk/edition/times2/theatre-review-girl-from-the-north-country-at-the-old-vic-se1-rz5t3687d"},{"cn":"Terry Teachout","o":"The Wall Street Journal","s":89,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.wsj.com/articles/girl-from-the-north-country-review-back-home-again-on-desolation-row-11583437370","q":"What Mr. McPherson does with Mr. Dylan’s songs is infallibly right."},{"cn":"David Finkle","o":"New York Stage Review","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://nystagereview.com/2022/05/29/girl-from-the-north-country-bob-dylan-musical-remains-superb/","d":"2022-05-29","q":"It reopened April 29, 2022, confirming this reviewer’s belief that the property is the best musical — jukebox or no — of the past three years."},{"cn":"Tim Teeman","o":"The Daily Beast","s":86,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.thedailybeast.com/bob-dylan-musical-girl-from-the-north-country-brilliantly-reborn-on-broadway/?via=twitter_page","q":"Everything in this exquisite Broadway transfer is in perfectly rendered unison."},{"cn":"Matt Windman","o":"amNewYork","s":85,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.amny.com/entertainment/theater/review-girl-from-the-north-country-is-a-genuinely-soulful-and-cathartic-experience/","q":"But under McPherson’s focused direction, it is unusually transfixing."},{"cn":"Simon Saltzman","o":"CurtainUp","s":83,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.curtainup.com/girlfromthenorthcountrybway.html","q":"Now their melancholy lyricism and sublime melodies make me feel almost foolish for my failure to fully appreciate them earlier."},{"cn":"David Browne","o":"Rolling Stone","s":64,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.rollingstone.com/music/music-live-reviews/dylan-musical-girl-from-the-north-country-broadway-review-960576/","q":"It's as audacious, enlightening, and exasperating as the man himself."}